{%- comment -%}
  Featured Piece — spotlights a single product from a collection, rotating on a date seed.

  Shopify Liquid has no random filter, so "pick one" has to come from somewhere
  deterministic. This reuses the rotation already proven in lena-spotlight.liquid:
  seed an integer off the current date, modulo the pool size, pick by index. Every
  visitor sees the same piece for the whole period, which reads as curation rather
  than chance and costs no JavaScript.

  Two rules the section enforces on its own:

    - Sold-out pieces are excluded from the pool. Most of the catalogue is one of a
      kind, so featuring a piece that has already sold is worse than showing nothing.
    - The section is absent entirely when the collection is blank or holds nothing
      available, rather than rendering an empty frame.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign fp_collection = section.settings.collection

  comment
    where: 'available' is the single-argument truthy form. The two-argument
    form compares against a string and does not reliably match a boolean.

    KNOWN LIMIT (R15 in docs/OPEN_ITEMS.md): outside a paginate tag,
    collection.products returns at most 50 products. So fp_pool is filtered from the
    first 50 of the collection in its own sort order, not from all of it. Pointed at a
    collection of 112, this section can only ever feature 50 of them.

    Liquid offers no way round this in a section - paginate takes its page from the URL,
    which a homepage section does not control. The practical answer is a collection sized
    to the job rather than a large one, which is why the setting's help text now says so.
  endcomment
  assign fp_pool = fp_collection.products | where: 'available'
  assign fp_pool_size = fp_pool.size
-%}

{%- if fp_collection != blank and fp_pool_size > 0 -%}
  {%- liquid
    comment
      The seed counts days since the epoch, not a position in the calendar.

      It used to read a calendar field directly: '%m' for monthly, which only ever takes
      12 values, so a pool larger than 12 could never show its 13th piece and the same
      month always picked the same index every year. '%W' capped weekly at 54 the same
      way. '%j' was fine at 366 but reset each year.

      Days since the epoch only ever increases, so modulo covers the whole pool for every
      rotation setting.
    endcomment
    assign fp_days = 'now' | date: '%s' | divided_by: 86400

    case section.settings.rotation
      when 'weekly'
        assign fp_seed = fp_days | divided_by: 7
      when 'monthly'
        assign fp_seed = fp_days | divided_by: 30
      else
        assign fp_seed = fp_days
    endcase

    assign fp_index = fp_seed | modulo: fp_pool_size

    assign fp_i = 0
    for fp_product in fp_pool
      if fp_i == fp_index
        assign featured = fp_product
        break
      endif
      assign fp_i = fp_i | plus: 1
    endfor

    assign fp_qty = featured.selected_or_first_available_variant.inventory_quantity | default: 0
  -%}

  {%- style -%}
    .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
    }
    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
        padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
        padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
      }
    }
  {%- endstyle -%}

  <div class="color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} gradient section-{{ section.id }}-padding">
    <div class="page-width">
      <div class="lena-fp">
        <a class="lena-fp-media" href="{{ featured.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
          {%- if featured.featured_media -%}
            <img
              src="{{ featured.featured_media | image_url: width: 1100 }}"
              srcset="
                {{ featured.featured_media | image_url: width: 550 }} 550w,
                {{ featured.featured_media | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w,
                {{ featured.featured_media | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w
              "
              sizes="(min-width: 750px) 50vw, 100vw"
              alt="{{ featured.featured_media.alt | default: featured.title | escape }}"
              width="{{ featured.featured_media.width }}"
              height="{{ featured.featured_media.height }}"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          {%- else -%}
            <div class="lena-fp-placeholder">Photo coming soon</div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </a>

        <div class="lena-fp-body">
          {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
            <div class="lena-section-eye">
              <span class="dm gold sm"></span> {{ section.settings.eyebrow }}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
            <h2 class="lena-fp-heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if featured.type != blank -%}
            <div class="lena-fp-cat">{{ featured.type }}</div>
          {%- endif -%}

          <h3 class="lena-fp-title">
            <a href="{{ featured.url }}">{{ featured.title | escape }}</a>
          </h3>

          {%- if fp_qty > 0 -%}
            <div class="lena-fp-badge">
              <span class="dm gold sm"></span>
              {%- if fp_qty == 1 -%}
                1 of 1
              {%- else -%}
                {{ fp_qty }} in stock
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="lena-fp-price">
            {%- render 'price', product: featured, price_class: '', show_compare_at_price: true -%}
          </div>

          {%- if fp_qty == 1 -%}
            <div class="lena-fp-scarcity">
              <span class="dm filled sm"></span> Only piece in existence
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if section.settings.description != blank -%}
            <p class="lena-fp-desc">{{ section.settings.description }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}

          <a href="{{ featured.url }}" class="lena-btn lena-btn-primary lena-fp-cta">
            {{ section.settings.cta_label | default: 'View this piece' }}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Featured Piece",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header", "footer"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection to feature from",
      "info": "One available piece is chosen from this collection. Sold-out pieces are skipped, and the section hides itself while nothing is available. Only the first 50 products of the collection can be reached, so a smaller, curated collection works better here than a large one."
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "rotation",
      "label": "Change the featured piece",
      "default": "daily",
      "options": [
        { "value": "daily", "label": "Every day" },
        { "value": "weekly", "label": "Every week" },
        { "value": "monthly", "label": "Every month" }
      ],
      "info": "Everyone sees the same piece for the whole period."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "Piece of the Day"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Today's <strong>Find</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "description",
      "label": "Supporting text",
      "info": "Optional. Shown under the price."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_label",
      "label": "Button label",
      "default": "View this piece"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:sections.all.colors.label",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.all.padding.section_padding_heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "t:sections.all.padding.padding_top",
      "default": 52
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "t:sections.all.padding.padding_bottom",
      "default": 52
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Featured Piece"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
